    "what_en": "Adds captions to a single-subject talking-head clip without editing it. Default: bottom rail plus one word embedded behind the subject. Optionally pure-embed cinematic, themed effects, or 35 identities. Transcription/matting run locally.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when a single-subject talking-head clip is given a caption request (verbatim, cinematic embed, 'zha'/VFX). Hard cuts, no clear face, or near-silent audio are refused or must be split.",
    "say_en": [
      {
